{"question_text": {"৪৮তম বিশেষ বিসিএস [স্বাস্থ্য] – মেডিকেল অংশ": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) Which of the following is a non essential component of cell?", "option1": "Mesosome", "option2": "Periplasm", "option3": "Nucleoid", "option4": "Plasmid", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0292.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1039\" height=\"688\" />"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) Which of the following bacteria can not be seen in gram staining?", "option1": "Salmonella typhi", "option2": "Haemophilus influenzae", "option3": "Chlamydia trachomatis", "option4": "Neisseria gonorrhoeae", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0293.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"903\" height=\"262\" />"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) Which of the following bacteria is a spore forming gram positive rod?", "option1": "Bacillus", "option2": "Listeria", "option3": "Actinomyces", "option4": "Corynebacterium", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0294.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"289\" />"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Which organism doesn’t pass through Gastrointestinal tract?", "option1": "Norovirus", "option2": "Rotavirus", "option3": "Hepatitis B virus", "option4": "Vibrio cholerae", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0295.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"875\" height=\"145\" />"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) Which of the following organism transmits through breast milk?", "option1": "Chlamydia trachomatis", "option2": "Parvovirus B19", "option3": "Human T cell leukaemia virus", "option4": "Streptococcus agalactiae", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0296.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"924\" height=\"376\" />"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) Which organism causes waterborne disease by penetration through cribriform plate ?", "option1": "Cryptosporidium parvum", "option2": "Naegleria fowleri", "option3": "Leptospira interrogans", "option4": "Pseudomonas aeruginosa", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0298.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"891\" height=\"377\" />"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) Pseudomembranous colitis is caused by-", "option1": "Clostridium perfringens", "option2": "Clostridium difficile", "option3": "Staph. aureus", "option4": "E.coli", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"909\" height=\"593\" />"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) Endotoxin doesn’t cause-", "option1": "Fever", "option2": "Hypertension", "option3": "Inflammation ", "option4": "Coagulation", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0301.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"446\" height=\"209\" />"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) Which antibacterial drug acts on 30s ribosomal subunit?", "option1": "Chloramphenicol", "option2": "Erythromycin", "option3": "Imipenem", "option4": "Tetracycline", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0302.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"909\" height=\"410\" />"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) Which of the following organism transmits through reheated rice?", "option1": "Staph. aureus", "option2": "Bacillus cereus", "option3": "Clostridium perfringens", "option4": "Listeria monocytogens", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0303.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"745\" height=\"340\" />"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) Neisseria gonorrhoeae doesn’t cause-", "option1": "Cervicitis", "option2": "Pelvic Inflammatory Disease", "option3": "Conjunctivitis", "option4": "Meningitis", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0304.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"936\" height=\"196\" />"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) Otitis media is caused by-", "option1": "Streptococcus pyogens", "option2": "Streptococcus agalactiae", "option3": "Streptococcus pneumoniae ", "option4": "Viridans streptococci ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0305.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"894\" height=\"385\" />"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) Haemolytic Uraemic Syndrome is caused by-", "option1": "E.coli O157:H7", "option2": "Salmonella ", "option3": "Shigella", "option4": "Campylobacter ", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0306.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"360\" />"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) Which organism causes mesenteric adenitis?", "option1": "Yersinia", "option2": "Proteus", "option3": "Serratia", "option4": "Klebsiella", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0307.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"897\" height=\"287\" />"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) Which organism causes epiglottitis?", "option1": "Haemophilus influenzae", "option2": "Bordetella pertussis", "option3": "Legionella pneumophilia", "option4": "Acinetobacter", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0308.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"712\" height=\"334\" />"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) Which organism causes relapsing fever?", "option1": "Borrelia recurrentis", "option2": "Borrelia burgdorferi", "option3": "Leptospira interrogans ", "option4": "Serratia", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0309.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1050\" height=\"502\" />"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) Which agar media is used for identifying Neisseria meningitides?", "option1": "Bordet gengou", "option2": "Blood agar", "option3": "Chocolate agar", "option4": "MacConkey agar media", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0310.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"757\" height=\"376\" />"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) Which one is single stranded DNA Virus?", "option1": "Parvovirus B19", "option2": "Papillomavirus", "option3": "Herpes virus", "option4": "Hepatitis B Virus", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0311.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"990\" height=\"234\" />"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) Which of the following is a member of retrovirus family?", "option1": "Rhinovirus", "option2": "Human T cell leukaemia virus", "option3": "Hepatitis A virus", "option4": "Hepatitis C virus", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0312_LKHJMir.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1010\" height=\"351\" />"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) Which is the animal reservoir of Hantavirus?", "option1": "Deer mice", "option2": "Monkey", "option3": "Bat", "option4": "Racoon", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0313.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1025\" height=\"402\" />"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) Which is not characteristic of fungi?", "option1": "Thermal dimorphism present", "option2": "Endospore used for survival", "option3": "Cell wall formed with chitin", "option4": "Nucleus eukaryotic ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0314.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"365\" />"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) Which one is Subcutaneous fungi?", "option1": "Sporothrix", "option2": "Malassezia", "option3": "Candida", "option4": "Cryptococcus", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0315.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"395\" />"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) Which fungi takes a stain with Indian Ink?", "option1": "Candida", "option2": "Cryptococcus", "option3": "Aspergillus", "option4": "Mucor ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0316.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1048\" height=\"451\" />"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) Which one is not an opportunistic fungi?", "option1": "Candida", "option2": "Aspergillus", "option3": "Trichophyton", "option4": "Pneumocystis ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0316_EcmRoTs.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1048\" height=\"451\" />"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) Which is not a systemic fungi?", "option1": "Histoplasma", "option2": "Coccidioides", "option3": "Blastomyces", "option4": "Malassezia", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0318.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1034\" height=\"462\" />"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) Which is not a tumour virus?", "option1": "Human Herpes Virus 8", "option2": "Hepatitis C", "option3": "Hepatitis B", "option4": "Human Herpes Virus 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0319.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1035\" height=\"352\" />"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) Which factor limits the growth of micro-organism within the body?", "option1": "Keratin", "option2": "Lysozyme", "option3": "Defensins", "option4": "Transferrin ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0320.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1040\" height=\"467\" />"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) Which is not a function of B cell?", "option1": "Tumour rejection", "option2": "Allergy", "option3": "Autoimmunity", "option4": "Opsionize Bacteria", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0321.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"631\" />"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) Which is not a function of Macrophage?", "option1": "Phagocytosis ", "option2": "Antigen presentation", "option3": "Cytokines production", "option4": "Killing of virus infected cell", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0322.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"756\" height=\"456\" />"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) Which Immunoglobulin prevents the attachment of Bacteria & virus to mucous membrane?", "option1": "IgA", "option2": "IgG", "option3": "IgM", "option4": "IgE", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0323.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"862\" height=\"959\" />"}, {"id": "31", "question": "৩১) Example of Type 3 Hypersensitivity-", "option1": "Haemolytic anaemia", "option2": "Contact dermatitis", "option3": "Rheumatic fever", "option4": "Serum Sickness", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0324.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1016\" height=\"322\" />"}, {"id": "32", "question": "৩২) Which organism is associated with Reactive arthritis?", "option1": "Streptococcus pyogens", "option2": "E.coli", "option3": "Chlamydia trachomatis", "option4": "Borrelia burgdorferi", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0325.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"893\" height=\"763\" />"}, {"id": "33", "question": "৩৩) Which of the following disease occurs due to T cell deficiency?", "option1": "Digeorge syndrome", "option2": "Selective IgA deficiency", "option3": "Bruton’s agammaglobulinemia", "option4": "Chronic granulomatous disease", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0326.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"904\" height=\"561\" />"}, {"id": "34", "question": "৩৪) Osteomyelitis in Prosthetic joint occurs due to-", "option1": "Staph. aureus", "option2": "Staph.epidermidis", "option3": "Pseudomonas aeruginosa", "option4": "Streptococcus agalactiae ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0327.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"679\" />"}, {"id": "35", "question": "৩৫) Cause of meningoencephalitis in pregnant lady-", "option1": "Streptococcus agalactiae", "option2": "Listeria monocytogens", "option3": "Staph. aureus", "option4": "Streptococcus pneumoniae", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0328.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"764\" height=\"1280\" />"}, {"id": "36", "question": "৩৬) Which organism causes bloody diarrhoea?", "option1": "Staph.aureus", "option2": "Bacillus cereus", "option3": "Listeria monocytogens ", "option4": "Campylobacter jejuni", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0329.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"680\" />"}, {"id": "37", "question": "৩৭) Malodorous green yellow thin discharge is found in - ", "option1": "Trichomoniasis", "option2": "Candida albicans", "option3": "Lactobacillus", "option4": "Gardenella vaginalis", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0330.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"928\" height=\"605\" />"}, {"id": "38", "question": "৩৮) Chancroid occurs due to-", "option1": "Haemophilus ducreyi", "option2": "Treponema pallidum", "option3": "Klebsiella granulomatosis", "option4": "Chlamydia trachomatis", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0331.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"935\" height=\"771\" />"}, {"id": "39", "question": "৩৯) Community acquired pneumonia in alcoholic person occurs due to-", "option1": "Klebsiella pneumoniae", "option2": "Chlamydia psittaci", "option3": "Pseudomonas aeruginosa", "option4": "Staph.aureus", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0333.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"651\" height=\"966\" />"}, {"id": "40", "question": "৪০) Conjunctivitis in neonate occurs due to-", "option1": "Chlamydia trachomatis", "option2": "Staph.aureus", "option3": "Streptococcus pneumoniae", "option4": "Haemophilus influenzae", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_0334.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"996\" height=\"290\" />"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 11513, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "1200000", "is_omr": true, "omr_time": "1440000", "examname": "Jun 13, 2025", "type": "BCS-Health-Medic", "payment": "BALANCE_NOT"}